      "type": "json",
      "metadata": {
        "items": [
          {
            "question": "1. What is the cost of possum removal in Melbourne?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >Possum removal in Melbourne typically costs between $150 to $400 depending on the situation and access difficulty. </span><b>7 States Pest Control</b><span > offers affordable and effective possum control services.</span></p><p><span >&nbsp;</span></p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "2. Is possum removal legal in Melbourne?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >Yes, possums are protected in Australia, so removal must follow strict regulations. <b>7 States Pest Control</b> uses legal and humane methods as per local laws.</span></p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "3. How do professionals remove possums safely?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >Professionals use humane trapping and relocation methods to safely remove possums. <b>7 States Pest Control</b> ensures ethical and compliant pest control practices.</span></p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "4. How quickly can possum removal be done?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >Possum removal usually takes a few hours, but complete prevention may take longer depending on the property. <b>7 States Pest Control</b> provides fast and reliable service.</span></p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "5. How can I prevent possums from entering my roof?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >To prevent possums, seal entry points, trim tree branches, and remove food sources. </span><b>7 States Pest Control</b><span > also provides prevention solutions to stop re-entry.</span></p>"
          }
        ]
