    },
    {
      "sort_order": 39,
      "block_key": "content.text_f6bb8ec",
      "section": "content",
      "label": "Content block 1",
      "type": "html",
      "value": "<p><b>Possum infestations</b><span > cause noise, damage, and hygiene issues in homes and businesses. Our </span><b>Melbourne possum pest control</b><span > handles all possum problems.</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 40,
      "block_key": "content.heading_cee4cbe",
      "section": "content",
      "label": "Heading: why Possum coming",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "why Possum coming"
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 41,
      "block_key": "content.heading_6d22bd0",
      "section": "content",
      "label": "Heading: Why Are Possums Coming Onto Your Property?",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Why Are Possums Coming Onto Your Property?"
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 42,
      "block_key": "content.text_59fd6df",
      "section": "content",
      "label": "Content block 2",
      "type": "html",
      "value": "<ol><li><b>Food Availability</b><span > – Fruit trees, vegetable gardens, pet food, and rubbish attract possums.</span><p>&nbsp;</p></li><li><b>Shelter &amp; Nesting</b><span > – Possums look for warm, safe spaces in roof cavities, wall gaps, sheds, and trees.</span><p>&nbsp;</p></li><li><b>Urban Expansion</b><span > – Ongoing development reduces natural habitats, pushing possums into residential areas.</span><p>&nbsp;</p></li><li><b>Breeding Season</b><span > – </span><b>Possum activity</b><span > increases during breeding periods, leading to more noise and movement.</span><p>&nbsp;</p></li><li><b>Easy Access Points</b><span > – Broken roof tiles, vents, and gaps make it easy for possums to enter.</span></li></ol>"
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 43,
      "block_key": "content.text_2e1c8d0",
      "section": "content",
      "label": "Content block 3",
      "type": "html",
      "value": "<p><span >If possum activity continues, professional </span><b>possum pest control in Melbourne</b><span > is the safest and most effective solution.</span></p>"
    },
